<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Why should we tarry when Jesus is pleading—</l><l>Pleading for you and for me?</l><l>Why should we linger and heed not His mercies—</l><l>Mercies for you and for me?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Time is now fleeting, the moments are passing—</l><l>Passing from you and from me;</l><l>Shadows are gathering, death-beds are coming—</l><l>Coming for you and for me!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, for the wonderful love He has promised—</l><l>Promised for you and for me!</l><l>Though we have sinned, He has mercy and pardon—</l><l>Pardon for you and for me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
